CNS — LOG 3I

Security, Governance, Human Control & Final Integration Fabric

Engineering Construction Specification — V1.1 FINAL

Status: FINAL / CHECKED / RECTIFIED / FROZEN


---

0. Authority and Boundary

Log 1 remains the constitutional authority.

Log 2 remains the capability and mechanism research authority.

Logs 3A–3H remain the detailed engineering authorities for their respective domains.

3I owns:

Security

Governance

Human control

Authority enforcement

Security monitoring and incident handling

Cross-layer integration

System-wide invariants

Final integration/release gates


3I does not become a second CNS brain, universal verifier, or replacement for another engineering volume.

The purpose of 3I is to ensure that independently constructed CNS subsystems can operate together without violating security, authority, safety, governance, or system-wide invariants.


---

