20. Security and Integration Metrics

3I should measure at least:

unauthorized-action block rate

false-denial rate

privilege-escalation detection rate

security detection latency

containment latency

blast-radius size

audit completeness

approval validity

policy evaluation latency

integration failure detection rate

cross-layer invariant coverage

rollback success rate

security regression rate

availability of safe unrelated operations during localized incidents


Metrics are used to improve the system rather than to create a meaningless single “security score.”


