21. Implementation Shape

3I should be implemented as a governed security/authority/integration layer over the existing CNS contracts.

It should not replace those contracts.

Conceptual interfaces include:

Identity
Authentication
Authorization
AuthorityContext
PolicyEvaluation
ApprovalValidation
SecurityEvent
IncidentLifecycle
ExtensionQualification
IntegrationCheck
DeploymentGate
EmergencyControl

Each interface should remain replaceable behind stable CNS contracts.

Implementation must preserve:

STABLE OUTSIDE
FLEXIBLE INSIDE


